# Test: boot refuses the no-mode DNS source configuration with exit 1.
# VALIDATES: the daemon startup entry point reports the DNS source refusal.
# A unit test cannot prove the launched daemon exits with that diagnostic.
# PREVENTS: a later successful validate command masking this startup failure.
# Companion validation and accepted forms: dns-source-mode-required.ci

stdin=no-mode:terminator=EOF_NO_MODE
system {
	name-server [ 198.51.100.53 ]
	dns-source {
		source [ configured received ]
	}
}
EOF_NO_MODE

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze -:stdin=no-mode:timeout=30s
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stderr:contains=system dns-source names 2 sources (configured, received) and no mode
